###  http://www.semanticweb.org/nikos/ontologies/2025/2/TextOntology/FullText
<http://www.semanticweb.org/nikos/ontologies/2025/2/TextOntology/FullText> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                           rdfs:subClassOf [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                                             owl:onProperty <http://www.semanticweb.org/nikos/ontologies/2025/2/semanticApp#isFullTextOF> ;
                                                                                             owl:qualifiedCardinality "1"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
