###  http://www.semanticweb.org/nikos/ontologies/2025/2/semanticApp/Author
<http://www.semanticweb.org/nikos/ontologies/2025/2/semanticApp/Author> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                        rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.semanticweb.org/nikos/ontologies/2025/2/semanticApp/Person> ,
